<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Imprisoned XII"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="TV动画《BanG Dream! Ave Mujica》插曲"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Ave Mujica"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Imprisoned XII"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Imprisoned XII - Single"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPR562500063"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2680457871"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="001kDpc30w9cmt"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="1dVwOcHSisM4Sv3yJ1zgos"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1796790572"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="50747104"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Xionghaizi001"/><amll:meta key="UPC" value="198704368547"/><amll:meta key="Copyright" value="℗ 2025 BUSHIROAD MUSIC INC."/></metadata></head><body dur="2:55.514"><div begin="13.568" end="2:55.514"><p begin="13.568" end="20.353" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.568" end="13.710">ね</span><span begin="13.710" end="14.328">じ</span><span begin="14.328" end="14.990">れ</span><span begin="15.243" end="15.392">た</span><span begin="15.392" end="15.854" amll:empty-beat="1">空</span><span begin="15.854" end="16.429">を</span><span begin="16.997" end="17.456" amll:empty-beat="1">描</span><span begin="17.456" end="17.726">い</span><span begin="17.726" end="18.681">て</span><span begin="18.681" end="19.078" amll:empty-beat="1">思</span><span begin="19.078" end="19.266">う</span><span begin="19.266" end="19.910">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">描绘扭曲天空，我不禁去遐想 / As I paint the twisted sky, I think</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ne ji re ta so ra wo e ga i te o mo u no</span></p><p begin="20.353" end="26.510" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.353" end="20.553">羽</span><span begin="20.553" end="21.139">根</span><span begin="21.139" end="21.720">の</span><span begin="21.720" end="22.242">な</span><span begin="22.242" end="22.453">い</span><span begin="22.453" end="23.350" amll:empty-beat="1">君</span><span begin="23.769" end="23.959">堕</span><span begin="23.959" end="24.920">ち</span><span begin="25.370" end="25.582">れ</span><span begin="25.582" end="25.824">ば</span><span begin="25.824" end="26.195">い</span><span begin="26.195" end="26.510">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">愿无羽翼的你，堕临至我身旁 / I wish you, without wings, just fall</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ha ne no na i ki mi o chi re ba i i</span></p><p begin="27.203" end="34.042" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.203" end="27.417">触</span><span begin="27.417" end="27.978">れ</span><span begin="27.978" end="28.806">て</span><span begin="28.806" end="29.119">し</span><span begin="29.119" end="29.340">ま</span><span begin="29.340" end="29.549">っ</span><span begin="29.549" end="30.287">た</span><span begin="30.564" end="31.189" amll:empty-beat="1">神</span><span begin="31.189" end="32.544" amll:empty-beat="1">聖</span><span begin="32.544" end="32.771">な</span><span begin="32.771" end="33.030">も</span><span begin="33.030" end="33.603">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不幸触碰了，神圣高洁之物 / I touched something sacred</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fu re te shi ma tta shi n se i na mo no</span></p><p begin="34.042" end="42.615" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.042" end="34.788" amll:empty-beat="1">今</span><span begin="34.788" end="35.326">夜</span><span begin="35.326" end="36.371" amll:empty-beat="2">私</span><span begin="36.371" end="37.149">の</span><span begin="37.356" end="38.510" amll:empty-beat="1">神</span><span begin="39.156" end="39.373">話</span><span begin="39.373" end="39.943">に</span><span begin="39.943" end="40.512">な</span><span begin="40.512" end="41.068">っ</span><span begin="41.068" end="42.615">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只求你在今夜，成为我的神话 / Tonight, become my myth</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ko n ya wa ta shi no shi n wa ni na tte</span></p><p begin="42.615" end="47.326" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.615" end="42.865">ほ</span><span begin="42.865" end="43.400">ら</span><span begin="43.943" end="44.153">逃</span><span begin="44.153" end="44.341">げ</span><span begin="44.341" end="44.520">ら</span><span begin="44.520" end="45.061">れ</span><span begin="45.061" end="45.622">な</span><span begin="45.622" end="46.176">い</span><span begin="46.176" end="47.000">わ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">看吧，你已无路可逃 / Look, you can&apos;t escape</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ho ra ni ge ra re na i wa</span></p><p begin="47.326" end="53.880" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.326" end="49.012" amll:empty-beat="1">弱</span><span begin="49.012" end="49.314">っ</span><span begin="49.314" end="49.528">て</span><span begin="49.528" end="49.753">い</span><span begin="49.753" end="50.472">く</span><span begin="50.712" end="51.112" amll:empty-beat="1">君</span><span begin="51.112" end="51.299">閉</span><span begin="51.299" end="51.891">じ</span><span begin="51.891" end="52.459">込</span><span begin="52.459" end="53.027">め</span><span begin="53.027" end="53.880">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">将逐渐虚弱的你，紧紧关住 / I confine you as you weaken</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yo wa tte i ku ki mi to ji ko me te</span></p><p begin="54.039" end="1:04.823" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.039" end="54.185">You</span> <span begin="54.185" end="54.549">know</span> <span begin="54.549" end="54.757">I</span> <span begin="54.757" end="56.077">want...</span> <span begin="56.267" end="56.465">I</span> <span begin="56.465" end="57.695">want...</span> <span begin="57.940" end="58.173">I</span> <span begin="58.173" end="59.436">want...</span> <span begin="59.727" end="59.893">I</span> <span begin="59.893" end="1:01.294">want</span> <span begin="1:01.294" end="1:01.893">you</span> <span begin="1:01.893" end="1:03.022">so,</span> <span begin="1:03.022" end="1:03.656">I</span> <span begin="1:03.656" end="1:04.578">want...</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你知晓我渴望...我渴望...我渴望...我如此渴望着你...</span></p><p begin="1:04.823" end="1:08.256" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.823" end="1:04.994">い</span><span begin="1:04.994" end="1:05.194">な</span><span begin="1:05.194" end="1:05.342">け</span><span begin="1:05.342" end="1:05.567">れ</span><span begin="1:05.567" end="1:05.760">ば</span><span begin="1:05.760" end="1:05.939">よ</span><span begin="1:05.939" end="1:06.134">か</span><span begin="1:06.134" end="1:06.316">っ</span><span begin="1:06.316" end="1:06.513">た</span><span begin="1:06.513" end="1:06.718">の</span><span begin="1:06.718" end="1:07.430">に</span> <span begin="1:07.707" end="1:07.851">な</span><span begin="1:07.851" end="1:08.256">ぜ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">若不存在该多好，为何... / I wish you weren&apos;t here, but why</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i na ke re ba yo ka tta no ni na ze</span></p><p begin="1:08.256" end="1:18.503" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.256" end="1:08.520">You</span> <span begin="1:08.520" end="1:09.725">know...</span> <span begin="1:09.915" end="1:10.129">you</span> <span begin="1:10.129" end="1:11.398">know...</span> <span begin="1:11.594" end="1:11.824">you</span> <span begin="1:11.824" end="1:13.153">know...</span> <span begin="1:13.320" end="1:13.501">you</span> <span begin="1:13.501" end="1:14.507">know</span> <span begin="1:14.507" end="1:14.684">I</span> <span begin="1:14.684" end="1:15.030">want</span> <span begin="1:15.030" end="1:15.239">you</span> <span begin="1:15.239" end="1:15.615">to</span> <span begin="1:15.615" end="1:16.278">know</span> <span begin="1:16.278" end="1:16.395">how</span> <span begin="1:16.395" end="1:16.838">much</span> <span begin="1:16.838" end="1:16.971">I</span> <span begin="1:16.971" end="1:17.394">need</span> <span begin="1:17.394" end="1:17.515">you</span> <span begin="1:17.515" end="1:18.243">so</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你知晓...你知晓...你知晓...我渴望你知晓，我对你如此渴求</span></p><p begin="1:18.503" end="1:22.532" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.503" end="1:18.683">い</span><span begin="1:18.683" end="1:19.054">ま</span> <span begin="1:19.054" end="1:19.645" amll:empty-beat="1">狂</span><span begin="1:19.645" end="1:19.849">お</span><span begin="1:19.849" end="1:20.024">し</span><span begin="1:20.024" end="1:20.318">い</span><span begin="1:20.318" end="1:20.516">ほ</span><span begin="1:20.516" end="1:22.532">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此刻我如痴如狂 / Right now, madly so</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i ma ku ru o shi i ho do</span></p><p begin="1:33.228" end="1:36.727" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.228" end="1:33.486">わ</span><span begin="1:33.486" end="1:33.713">か</span><span begin="1:33.713" end="1:34.003">っ</span><span begin="1:34.003" end="1:34.636">て</span><span begin="1:34.968" end="1:35.190">る</span><span begin="1:35.190" end="1:35.388">の</span><span begin="1:35.388" end="1:35.564">で</span><span begin="1:35.564" end="1:36.060">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我清楚地知晓 / I knew, but for now</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wa ka tte ru no de mo</span></p><p begin="1:36.727" end="1:39.663" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.727" end="1:36.897">い</span><span begin="1:36.897" end="1:37.418">ま</span><span begin="1:37.418" end="1:38.045">は</span><span begin="1:38.045" end="1:38.622" amll:empty-beat="1">密</span><span begin="1:38.622" end="1:38.816">や</span><span begin="1:38.816" end="1:39.005">か</span><span begin="1:39.005" end="1:39.663">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但现在就悄悄 / I secretly spend</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i ma wa hi so ya ka ni</span></p><p begin="1:40.085" end="1:46.120" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.085" end="1:40.312">奇</span><span begin="1:40.312" end="1:41.461" amll:empty-beat="1">妙</span><span begin="1:41.461" end="1:41.858">な</span><span begin="1:41.858" end="1:42.030">時</span><span begin="1:42.030" end="1:42.496" amll:empty-beat="1">間</span><span begin="1:42.496" end="1:43.093">を</span><span begin="1:43.497" end="1:43.724">た</span><span begin="1:43.724" end="1:44.200">だ</span><span begin="1:45.077" end="1:45.450" amll:empty-beat="1">君</span><span begin="1:45.450" end="1:46.120">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只与你共度过，这奇妙的时光 / This strange time just with you</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki myo u na ji ka n wo ta da ki mi to</span></p><p begin="1:46.905" end="1:53.772" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.905" end="1:47.547" amll:empty-beat="1">冷</span><span begin="1:47.547" end="1:47.800">た</span><span begin="1:47.800" end="1:48.645">い</span><span begin="1:48.645" end="1:48.844">こ</span><span begin="1:48.844" end="1:49.087">の</span><span begin="1:49.087" end="1:49.276">手</span><span begin="1:49.276" end="1:49.932">で</span><span begin="1:50.347" end="1:50.935" amll:empty-beat="1">愛</span><span begin="1:50.935" end="1:51.890">す</span><span begin="1:52.077" end="1:52.265">べ</span><span begin="1:52.265" end="1:52.480">き</span><span begin="1:52.480" end="1:52.686">も</span><span begin="1:52.686" end="1:53.403">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我埋葬我所爱，用冰冷的双手 / With these cold hands, I bury what I should love</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tsu me ta i ko no te de a i su be ki mo no</span></p><p begin="1:53.772" end="2:00.245" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.772" end="1:55.106" amll:empty-beat="2">葬</span><span begin="1:55.106" end="1:55.481">る</span><span begin="1:55.481" end="1:56.120" amll:empty-beat="2">私</span><span begin="1:56.120" end="1:56.835">を</span><span begin="1:57.167" end="1:57.376">受</span><span begin="1:57.376" end="1:58.010">け</span><span begin="1:58.927" end="1:59.089">入</span><span begin="1:59.089" end="1:59.657">れ</span><span begin="1:59.657" end="2:00.245">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只求你能接纳，如此不堪的我 / Please accept me</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ho u mu ru wa ta shi wo u ke i re te</span></p><p begin="2:00.245" end="2:07.022" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.245" end="2:02.540" amll:empty-beat="2">危</span><span begin="2:02.540" end="2:03.342">き</span><span begin="2:03.663" end="2:03.842">こ</span><span begin="2:03.842" end="2:04.044">こ</span><span begin="2:04.044" end="2:04.262">ろ</span><span begin="2:04.262" end="2:04.806">の</span><span begin="2:04.806" end="2:05.961" amll:empty-beat="1">壁</span><span begin="2:05.961" end="2:06.600">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">心灵之壁摇摇欲坠 / On the perilous walls of my heart</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a ya u ki ko ko ro no ka be ni</span></p><p begin="2:07.022" end="2:13.435" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.022" end="2:09.163" amll:empty-beat="1">忍</span><span begin="2:09.163" end="2:09.367">ぶ</span><span begin="2:09.367" end="2:10.160">は</span><span begin="2:10.511" end="2:10.645">理</span><span begin="2:10.645" end="2:10.802">不</span><span begin="2:10.802" end="2:11.629" amll:empty-beat="1">尽</span><span begin="2:11.629" end="2:12.191">な</span><span begin="2:12.191" end="2:13.435" amll:empty-beat="1">夢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">残酷梦境暗藏其中 / Sneaks an unreasonable dream</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shi no bu wa ri fu ji n na yu me</span></p><p begin="2:13.715" end="2:17.020" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.715" end="2:13.875">I</span> <span begin="2:13.875" end="2:14.377">say,</span> <span begin="2:14.377" end="2:14.648">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:14.648" end="2:15.540">mine...</span> <span begin="2:16.002" end="2:16.300">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:16.300" end="2:17.020">mine...</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我说，你属于我...你属于我...</span></p><p begin="2:17.791" end="2:26.210" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:17.791" end="2:18.070">ほ</span><span begin="2:18.070" end="2:18.940">ら</span><span begin="2:19.341" end="2:19.729">す</span><span begin="2:19.729" end="2:20.780">ぐ</span><span begin="2:20.996" end="2:21.347">そ</span><span begin="2:21.347" end="2:21.940">こ</span><span begin="2:22.767" end="2:22.948">に</span><span begin="2:22.948" end="2:23.066">い</span><span begin="2:23.066" end="2:23.800">る</span><span begin="2:24.592" end="2:24.740">の</span><span begin="2:24.740" end="2:25.200">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">看吧，分明近在咫尺 / Look, you&apos;re so close, yet still</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ho ra su gu so ko ni i ru no ni</span></p><p begin="2:26.210" end="2:29.615" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.210" end="2:26.716" amll:empty-beat="1">叶</span><span begin="2:26.716" end="2:26.840">わ</span><span begin="2:26.840" end="2:27.067">な</span><span begin="2:27.067" end="2:27.279">い</span><span begin="2:27.279" end="2:27.595">そ</span><span begin="2:27.595" end="2:27.966">れ</span><span begin="2:27.966" end="2:28.169">で</span><span begin="2:28.169" end="2:29.311">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无法实现，纵使如此 / Unfulfilled, and yet</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ka na wa na i so re de mo</span></p><p begin="2:29.615" end="2:38.049" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.615" end="2:29.846">I</span> <span begin="2:29.846" end="2:31.154">want...</span> <span begin="2:31.348" end="2:31.593">I</span> <span begin="2:31.593" end="2:32.900">want...</span> <span begin="2:33.104" end="2:33.305">I</span> <span begin="2:33.305" end="2:34.539">want</span> <span begin="2:34.539" end="2:35.251">you</span> <span begin="2:35.251" end="2:36.431">so,</span> <span begin="2:36.431" end="2:37.086">I</span> <span begin="2:37.086" end="2:38.049">want</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我渴望...我渴望...我如此渴望着你...</span></p><p begin="2:38.310" end="2:41.648" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.310" end="2:38.642" amll:empty-beat="1">想</span><span begin="2:38.642" end="2:38.818">い</span><span begin="2:38.818" end="2:39.002">出</span><span begin="2:39.002" end="2:39.148">な</span><span begin="2:39.148" end="2:39.352">ん</span><span begin="2:39.352" end="2:39.570">て</span><span begin="2:39.570" end="2:39.747">い</span><span begin="2:39.747" end="2:39.964">ら</span><span begin="2:39.964" end="2:40.115">な</span><span begin="2:40.115" end="2:40.763">い</span> <span begin="2:40.997" end="2:41.213">だ</span><span begin="2:41.213" end="2:41.453">か</span><span begin="2:41.453" end="2:41.648">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不需要回忆所以... / I don&apos;t need any memories, so...</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">o mo i de na n te i ra na i da ka ra</span></p><p begin="2:41.648" end="2:51.705" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:41.648" end="2:41.834">You</span> <span begin="2:41.834" end="2:42.944">know</span> <span begin="2:43.303" end="2:43.561">you</span> <span begin="2:43.561" end="2:44.750">know</span> <span begin="2:45.017" end="2:45.262">you</span> <span begin="2:45.262" end="2:46.477">know...</span> <span begin="2:46.477" end="2:46.814">so,</span> <span begin="2:46.814" end="2:46.996">you</span> <span begin="2:46.996" end="2:47.919">know</span> <span begin="2:47.919" end="2:48.099">I</span> <span begin="2:48.099" end="2:48.518">want</span> <span begin="2:48.518" end="2:48.671">you</span> <span begin="2:48.671" end="2:49.082">to</span> <span begin="2:49.082" end="2:49.678">know</span> <span begin="2:49.678" end="2:49.826">how</span> <span begin="2:49.826" end="2:50.269">much</span> <span begin="2:50.269" end="2:50.379">I</span> <span begin="2:50.379" end="2:50.777">need</span> <span begin="2:50.777" end="2:50.918">you</span> <span begin="2:50.918" end="2:51.705">so</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你知晓...你知晓...你知晓...所以，你知晓...我渴望你知晓，我对你如此渴求</span></p><p begin="2:51.903" end="2:55.514" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:51.903" end="2:52.074">い</span><span begin="2:52.074" end="2:52.477">ま</span><span begin="2:52.477" end="2:53.127" amll:empty-beat="1">狂</span><span begin="2:53.127" end="2:53.244">お</span><span begin="2:53.244" end="2:53.412">し</span><span begin="2:53.412" end="2:53.633">い</span><span begin="2:53.633" end="2:53.922">ほ</span><span begin="2:53.922" end="2:55.514">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此刻我如痴如狂 / Right now, madly so</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i ma ku ru o shi i ho do</span></p></div></body></tt>